        <mxCell id="notes-title" value="Architecture Notes &amp; Key Information" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Arial;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="170" y="1165" width="1410" height="25" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes-content" value="&lt;b&gt;System Overview:&lt;/b&gt; KruzeApp is a comprehensive omnichannel business management system for specialty coffee &amp; tea retail operations.&#xa;&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Technology Stack:&lt;/b&gt; React 18 + TypeScript + TailwindCSS + shadcn/ui | Express.js 4.21 + Node.js (ES modules) | PostgreSQL + Drizzle ORM | Replit OpenID Connect | Resend Email | PDFKit&#xa;&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Key Architectural Patterns:&lt;/b&gt; Clean Architecture (Routes → Services → Storage → Database) | Service Layer Pattern | Repository Pattern | Transaction Pattern (ACID compliance) | Middleware Pattern (auth, logging, error handling)&#xa;&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Security:&lt;/b&gt; HTTP Security Headers via Helmet (CSP, HSTS, XSS Protection) | CORS with origin validation | Rate Limiting (1000 req/15min API, 10 req/15min auth) | Zod schema validation | Row-level locking | PostgreSQL session storage (7-day TTL)&#xa;&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Data Model:&lt;/b&gt; 30+ database tables | Complex pricing strategy (B2B/B2C prices, customer-specific overrides, date-ranged validity) | Split payment support | Automatic stock movement generation | Coffee roasting workflow tracking (green → roasted) | Flexible product blending&#xa;&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Future Roadmap (Loyalty App):&lt;/b&gt; Email verification authentication | Points system (€1 = 1 point) | Achievement badges &amp; monthly challenges | Product reviews with photos | Reward redemption with QR vouchers | Daily tips &amp; brewing guides | Push notifications&#xa;&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Deployment:&lt;/b&gt; Replit platform with PostgreSQL hosting, Resend email connector, and OpenID Connect integration&#xa;&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Key Business Features:&lt;/b&gt; Multi-interface design (Admin, POS, Storefront, Loyalty App planned) | Split payment processing | Dynamic pricing by customer type | Automated inventory tracking | Coffee roasting workflow | Invoice generation &amp; email delivery | Comprehensive analytics | Customer relationship management" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=9;fontFamily=Arial;spacing=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="170" y="1200" width="1410" height="325" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
